        "section": "5.2",
        "section_title": "Unencoded JWS Compact Serialization Payload",
        "anchor": "section-5.2",
        "line_start": 412,
        "line_end": 425,
        "block_kind": "prose",
        "text": "Similarly, if a JWS using the JWS Compact Serialization and a non-detached payload is to be transmitted in a context that requires URL-safe characters, then the application MUST ensure that the payload contains only the URL-safe characters 'a'-'z', 'A'-'Z', '0'-'9', dash ('-'), underscore ('_'), and tilde ('~').",
        "text_sha256_12": "588d940407a7"
      },
